    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1.14
  m_Text: "<size=30><b><color=#00FFAA>1. HOW TO WIN:</color></b></size>\nUncover 3 matching symbols anywhere across any horizontal row to win that row's cash prize!\n\n<size=30><b><color=#00FFAA>2. MULTI-ROW PAYOUTS:</color></b></size>\nAll 5 rows evaluate independently. Win multiple rows simultaneously!\n\n<size=30><b><color=#00FFAA>3. NEAR-MISS PULSE:</color></b></size>\nMatch the first 2 cells to ignite an anticipation glow on the 3rd cell!\n\n<size=30><b><color=#00FFAA>4. QUICK REVEAL:</color></b></size>\nTap [REVEAL ALL] anytime to scratch all 5 rows instantly.\n\n<size=30><b><color=#FFD700>\u25C6 SYMBOL PAYTABLE:</color></b></size>\n  \u2022 Bronze Gear: 1x (35%)       \u2022 Plasma Gem: 15x (1.5%)\n  \u2022 Silver Ingot: 2x (22%)      \u2022 Cyber Crown: 50x (1.0%)\n  \u2022 Gold Core: 5x (12%)         \u2022 Lucky 777: 250x JACKPOT (0.1%)"
